  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "comment": "These strains were maintained on MRS agar slants containing (g/liter): peptone 10, ‘Lab-Lemco’ powder 8, YE 4, glucose 20, triammonium citrate 2, sodium acetate 5, K2HPO4 2, MgSO4·7H2O 0.2, MnSO4·H2O 0.05, CaCO3 10. The pH was adjusted to 6.5. The slants were incubated at 50°C or 37°C and the fully grown slants were stored at 4°C."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": ""
    }
  ]
}